{"body":{"condensations":[{"$ref":"1M7G5R5CJ1F66A0"},{"$ref":"1M7G5R5CJ1F66A1"},{"$ref":"1M7G5R5CJ1F66A2"},{"$ref":"1M7G5R5CJ1F66A3"},{"$ref":"1M7G5R5CJ1F66A4"}],"cycles":[{"$ref":"1M7G5R5CJ1F669V"},{"$ref":"1M7G5R5CJ1F669W"},{"$ref":"1M7G5R5CJ1F669X"},{"$ref":"1M7G5R5CJ1F669Y"},{"$ref":"1M7G5R5CJ1F669Z"}],"kept":"Whole in the author's words: every utterance as it came, typed or spoken, the session's reading which, with when it came, including those he sent while the session worked; where he interrupted a message and sent it again, longer, the longer is kept; one message part dictated and part typed kept as spoken; the few words the dictation misheard marked on the word, with what was written kept, and only where the meaning was plain; button answers kept as words. After each, the essence of the session's answer in its own voice, short. Its five stretches of work marked as cycles, each condensed. Blank agents read the record against the transcripts, the author's words and the answers, and what they found was mended. The work stands in commits 7f5d2d3 to b4a1af2 on engine-rewrite.","on":"2026-11-15","paths":[{"$ref":"1M7G5R5CJ1F669H"},{"$ref":"1M7G5R5CJ1F669J"},{"$ref":"1M7G5R5CJ1F669K"},{"$ref":"1M7G5R5CJ1F669M"},{"$ref":"1M7G5R5CJ1F669N"},{"$ref":"1M7G5R5CJ1F669P"},{"$ref":"1M7G5R5CJ1F669Q"},{"$ref":"1M7G5R5CJ1F669R"},{"$ref":"1M7G5R5CJ1F669S"},{"$ref":"1M7G5R5CJ1F669T"}],"said":[{"$ref":"1M7G5R5CJ1F600E"},{"$ref":"1M7G5R5CJ1F6027"},{"$ref":"1M7G5R5CJ1F6098"},{"$ref":"1M7G5R5CJ1F60D5"},{"$ref":"1M7G5R5CJ1F60FJ"},{"$ref":"1M7G5R5CJ1F60FZ"},{"$ref":"1M7G5R5CJ1F60KJ"},{"$ref":"1M7G5R5CJ1F60N6"},{"$ref":"1M7G5R5CJ1F60Q3"},{"$ref":"1M7G5R5CJ1F60R0"},{"$ref":"1M7G5R5CJ1F60TX"},{"$ref":"1M7G5R5CJ1F60V2"},{"$ref":"1M7G5R5CJ1F60XW"},{"$ref":"1M7G5R5CJ1F60YV"},{"$ref":"1M7G5R5CJ1F610W"},{"$ref":"1M7G5R5CJ1F611W"},{"$ref":"1M7G5R5CJ1F612Z"},{"$ref":"1M7G5R5CJ1F614Q"},{"$ref":"1M7G5R5CJ1F616N"},{"$ref":"1M7G5R5CJ1F61G7"},{"$ref":"1M7G5R5CJ1F61KF"},{"$ref":"1M7G5R5CJ1F61P3"},{"